      "severity": "Major",
      "rule": "workflow-clarity",
      "path": "plugins/git-kit/skills/handling-review-findings/SKILL.md",
      "line": 309,
      "evidence": "The Issue path instructs the agent to draft the issue under `issues/`, then invokes `git-review-api.py issue-create --body-file <path>` and only parenthetically says to write the text to the scratchpad first. The wrapper deterministically rejects any body file outside `<temp>/claude-<uid>/.../scratchpad`, including the repository `issues/` file.",
      "remediation": "Show two explicit paths/steps: write the canonical draft under `issues/...`, write the identical redacted content to a scratchpad file, pass the scratchpad path to `--body-file`, and retain/stage the repository draft separately.",
